<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>
    <record id="action_report_ras_certificate" model="ir.actions.report">
        <field name="name">Attestation RAS</field>
        <field name="model">account.ras.maroc</field>
        <field name="report_type">qweb-pdf</field>
        <field name="report_name">agh_invoice_supplier.ras_certificate</field>
        <field name="report_file">agh_invoice_supplier.ras_certificate</field>
        <field name="binding_model_id" ref="model_account_ras_maroc"/>
        <field name="binding_type">report</field>
    </record>

    <template id="ras_certificate">
        <t t-call="web.html_container">
            <t t-foreach="docs" t-as="ras">
                <t t-call="web.external_layout">
                    <div class="page" style="padding: 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">
                        <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
                            <h2>Attestation de Retenue a la Source</h2>
                            <h4>Article 153 du CGI - Maroc</h4>
                        </div>

                        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
                            <p><strong>N. Attestation: </strong><span t-esc="ras.certificate_number or 'En cours'"/></p>
                            <p><strong>Date: </strong><span t-field="ras.date"/></p>
                        </div>

                        <p>Je soussigne(e), <strong t-field="ras.company_id.name"/>,</p>
                        <p>atteste avoir preleve la retenue a la source sur le paiement effectue a:</p>

                        <div style="background-color: #f5f5f5; padding: 12px; margin: 16px 0;">
                            <p><strong>Fournisseur: </strong><span t-field="ras.partner_id.name"/></p>
                            <p><strong>ICE: </strong><span t-esc="ras.partner_id.agh_ice or ''"/></p>
                            <p><strong>IF: </strong><span t-esc="ras.partner_id.agh_tax_id or ''"/></p>
                        </div>

                        <p>au titre de la facture:</p>
                        <div style="background-color: #f5f5f5; padding: 12px; margin: 16px 0;">
                            <p><strong>N. Facture: </strong><span t-field="ras.invoice_id.name"/></p>
                            <p><strong>Date: </strong><span t-field="ras.invoice_id.invoice_date"/></p>
                            <p><strong>Montant TTC: </strong><span t-field="ras.invoice_id.amount_total" t-options="{'widget': 'monetary', 'display_currency': ras.currency_id}"/></p>
                        </div>

                        <p>Detail de la retenue:</p>
                        <table class="table table-bordered" style="width: 100%; margin: 16px 0;">
                            <thead>
                                <tr>
                                    <th>Nature</th>
                                    <th>Taux</th>
                                    <th>Base taxable</th>
                                    <th>Montant retenu</th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody>
                                <tr>
                                    <td><span t-esc="ras.ras_type"/></td>
                                    <td><span t-esc="ras.ras_rate"/>%</td>
                                    <td><span t-field="ras.taxable_base" t-options="{'widget': 'monetary', 'display_currency': ras.currency_id}"/></td>
                                    <td><span t-field="ras.ras_amount" t-options="{'widget': 'monetary', 'display_currency': ras.currency_id}"/></td>
                                </tr>
                            </tbody>
                        </table>

                        <p>La presente attestation est delivree pour servir et valoir ce que de droit.</p>

                        <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
                            <p>Fait a <span t-esc="ras.company_id.city or 'Casablanca'"/>, le <span t-field="ras.date"/></p>
                            <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
                                <p><strong>Cachet et signature</strong></p>
                                <div style="width: 200px; height: 80px; border: 1px solid #ccc; margin-top: 8px;"></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </t>
            </t>
        </t>
    </template>
</odoo>
